<%#
# AI models: the tab «Промпты»

The rules the platform adds to the prompt of every AI agent (the builder of system prompts) and the general instruction
for the agents. The group and the place of a rule are chosen from lists, a rule is deleted only after a confirmation.

## Local variables:

- `page`: the `SuperAdmin::AiModelsPage`.
%>
<% page.groups_of('prompts').each do |group| %>
  <section class="flex flex-col gap-3" aria-labelledby="ai-group-<%= group.key %>" data-testid="ai-group-<%= group.key %>">
    <div class="admin-block__head">
      <h2 class="admin-block__title" id="ai-group-<%= group.key %>"><%= group.title %></h2>
      <% if group.hint.present? %>
        <p class="admin-block__hint"><%= group.hint %></p>
      <% end %>
    </div>
    <div class="admin-slot-grid">
      <% group.slots.each do |slot| %>
        <%= render 'slot', slot: slot %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </section>
<% end %>
